 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！今天，我们来认识自己的身体。"
    },
    {
     "en": "body"
    },
    {
     "zh": "身体。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:body",
    "focus:body"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "从头到脚，整个的你，就是身体："
    },
    {
     "en": "body"
    },
    {
     "en": "This is my body."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:head",
    "focus:head"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "身体最上面，圆圆的，是头："
    },
    {
     "en": "head"
    },
    {
     "en": "Touch your head."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:hair",
    "edge:head>hair",
    "focus:hair"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "头上长着头发："
    },
    {
     "en": "hair"
    },
    {
     "zh": "头发有成千上万根，可这个词通常不加 s 哦。"
    },
    {
     "en": "I have black hair."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:neck",
    "edge:head>neck",
    "focus:neck"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "头和身体中间，连着脖子："
    },
    {
     "en": "neck"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "edge:neck>body",
    "focus:body"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "脖子下面，就是身体啦："
    },
    {
     "en": "body"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:shoulder",
    "edge:neck>shoulder",
    "focus:shoulder"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "脖子两边，又宽又平的地方是肩膀："
    },
    {
     "en": "shoulder"
    },
    {
     "en": "two shoulders"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:arm",
    "edge:shoulder>arm",
    "focus:arm"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "从肩膀往下，长长的是胳膊："
    },
    {
     "en": "arm"
    },
    {
     "en": "Raise your arms!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:hand",
    "edge:arm>hand",
    "focus:hand"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "胳膊的最下面，是手："
    },
    {
     "en": "hand"
    },
    {
     "en": "Clap your hands!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:finger",
    "edge:hand>finger",
    "focus:finger"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "还记得第三集吗？每只手上，都有五根手指："
    },
    {
     "en": "finger"
    },
    {
     "en": "five fingers"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:leg",
    "edge:body>leg",
    "focus:leg"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "身体下面，撑着我们走路、跑步的，是腿："
    },
    {
     "en": "leg"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:knee",
    "edge:leg>knee",
    "focus:knee"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "腿中间能弯起来的地方，是膝盖："
    },
    {
     "en": "knee"
    },
    {
     "zh": "小提示：开头的字母 k，是不发音的。"
    },
    {
     "en": "Bend your knees."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:foot",
    "edge:leg>foot",
    "focus:foot"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "腿的最下面，踩在地上的，是脚："
    },
    {
     "en": "foot"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:toe",
    "edge:foot>toe",
    "focus:toe"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "脚上也有五根小小的，叫脚趾："
    },
    {
     "en": "toe"
    },
    {
     "en": "Wiggle your toes!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:shake",
    "edge:shake>head",
    "focus:shake"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "最后学一个动作词：摇一摇、晃一晃，"
    },
    {
     "en": "shake"
    },
    {
     "zh": "摇头，是",
     "cue": [
      "focus:shake,head"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "shake your head"
    },
    {
     "zh": "握手，是",
     "cue": [
      "focus:shake,hand"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "shake hands"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:none"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "身体的很多部位，我们都有两个。变成很多个的时候，怎么说呢？"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:hand"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "大部分在后面加上字母 s 就好："
    },
    {
     "en": "hand",
     "cue": [
      "focus:hand"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "hands",
     "cue": [
      "plural:hand"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "leg",
